# 36. Canonicalization

Every indexable page should have a correct canonical.

Example:

`https://mingzy.space/random-video-chat`

should canonicalize to itself.

Avoid:

* HTTP/HTTPS duplicates
* www/non-www duplicates
* trailing-slash duplicates
* parameter duplicates
* duplicate route versions

Choose one canonical URL structure and enforce it.

