# 54. The Most Important SEO Principle

Do not optimize Mingzy to become:

> "a website containing pages about random video chat."

Optimize Mingzy to become:

> **"the web's best destination for people who want to have conversations with strangers based on language, region, and communication preference."**

That is the actual SEO moat.

Competitors can copy a title tag.

